# Deployment package build output — intentionally not version-controlled.
#
# public_html_ready/ is a generated copy of files already tracked
# elsewhere in this directory (see the *.html, css/, js/, images/, fonts/
# top-level entries) — committing it would duplicate ~217 MB of binary
# content already in the repo for no additional information.
#
# public_html_ready.zip is ~209 MB, which exceeds GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit and cannot be pushed without Git LFS.
#
# Both are reproducible with the copy described in FINAL_QA_REPORT.md
# §10, or by zipping the contents of public_html_ready/ once rebuilt.
public_html_ready/
public_html_ready.zip
